<in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock contextRef="OneD">Notes:tttttttttt  ntttttttttt  n1tResults are prepared in compliance with Indian Accounting Standards ( Ind-AS ) notified by the Ministry of Corporate Affairs.ttttttttt  n2tOperating revenue and cost for the year ended March 31, 2019 are not comparable with corresponding period because of implementation of GST resulting into change in tax structure with effect from July 1, 2017.ttttttttt  n3tThe Company operates only in one segment, namely   Cosmetics, Toiletries and Other Personal Care products  and there are no reportable segments in accordance with IND-AS 108 on  Operating Segments .ttttttttt  n4tIND-AS 115 'Revenue from Contracts with Customers', mandatory for reporting periods beginning on or after April 1, 2018, replaces existing revenue recognition requirements. Under the modified retrospective approach, there were no significant adjustments required to the retained earnings as at April 1, 2018. The adoption of the standard did not have any significant impact on the financial results. ttttttttt  n5tThe Company has granted Equity Stock Option in the nature of Restricted Stock Unit (RSU) to certain employees on Aug 14, 2018, same has been accounted in accordance with IND-AS 102 along with guidance note issued by ICAI and guidelines issued by SEBI.ttttttttt  n6tThe Board of Directors of the Company at their meeting held on January 09, 2019, have declared an Interim Dividend of 1400% (i.e. Rs. 14/- per share on equity shares of the face value of  Rs. 1/- each) for the financial year ended March 31, 2019. The Board do not propose any Final Dividend and accordingly, the Interim Dividend paid during the year shall be treated as Final Dividend for the Financial Year ended March 31, 2019.ttttttttt  n7tThe Figures of the last quarter are the balancing figure between audited figure in respect of full financial year and pubilshed year to date figures upto third quarter of the respective financial year.ttttttttt  n8tFigures have been regrouped/rearranged wherever necessary.ttttttttt  n9tThe above results have been reviewed by the Audit Committee and approved by the Board of Directors at their respective meetings held on Apr, 09 2019.ttttttttt  ntttttttttt  ntttttttFor and on behalf of Board of Directors  ntttttttttt  ntttttttttt  nttttttttSumit Malhotra  nPlace  t:tMumbaittttttManaging Director  nDate    t: tApril 9, 2019ttttt(DIN 02183825)  ntttttttttt  n </in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock>
